      "content": "<!--\n  Research — a publication home page: translucent nav, centred prompt hero\n  with quick-action pills, a bento lead story, and a recent-news row.\n  Drawn at 1280×800. Thumbnails are real photos hotlinked from Unsplash.\n-->\n<div class=\"h-[800px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-white font-sans text-black antialiased dark:bg-neutral-950 dark:text-gray-100\">\n  <!-- Nav -->\n  <header class=\"w-full border-b border-black/5 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-neutral-950/70\">\n    <nav class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-8\" aria-label=\"Global\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center gap-2\">\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"text-black dark:text-white\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12C2 17.52 6.48 22 12 22C17.52 22 22 17.52 22 12C22 6.48 17.52 2 12 2ZM11 19.93C7.06 19.43 4 16.05 4 12C4 7.95 7.06 4.57 11 4.07V19.93ZM13 4.07C16.94 4.57 20 7.95 20 12C20 16.05 16.94 19.43 13 19.93V4.07Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight\">Aperture</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex gap-x-8\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:text-black dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-white\">Research</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:text-black dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-white\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:text-black dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-white\">Business</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:text-black dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-white\">Developers</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:text-black dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-white\">Company</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-end gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-black transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-white/10\">Log in</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full bg-black px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#333333] dark:bg-white dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200\">Try it free ↗</a>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"px-8 pt-12\">\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <section class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\">\n      <h1 class=\"mb-8 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-black md:text-5xl dark:text-gray-100\">What can I help with?</h1>\n\n      <!-- Composer -->\n      <div class=\"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-[640px] text-left\">\n        <form class=\"w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white shadow-sm transition-colors focus-within:border-[#d1d5db] focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-[#f3f4f6] dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-neutral-900 dark:focus-within:border-white/25 dark:focus-within:ring-white/10\">\n          <label for=\"sr-message\" class=\"sr-only\">Message</label>\n          <textarea\n            id=\"sr-message\"\n            rows=\"2\"\n            placeholder=\"Send a message…\"\n            class=\"block w-full resize-none bg-transparent px-4 pb-2 pt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-foreground outline-none placeholder:text-[#9ca3af] dark:text-gray-100 dark:placeholder:text-muted-foreground\"\n          ></textarea>\n\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 pb-3 pt-1\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-lg p-1.5 text-[#9ca3af] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 hover:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-gray-200\" aria-label=\"Add attachment\">\n                <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                  <path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\" />\n                </svg>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-[13px] text-[#6b7280] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 hover:text-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-gray-100\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"text-[#9ca3af]\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                  <path d=\"M12 12c-2-2.67-4-4-6-4a4 4 0 1 0 0 8c2 0 4-1.33 6-4Zm0 0c2 2.67 4 4 6 4a4 4 0 0 0 0-8c-2 0-4 1.33-6 4Z\" />\n                </svg>\n                Agent\n                <svg class=\"ml-0.5 text-[#9ca3af] opacity-70\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                  <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\" />\n                </svg>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"mr-1 flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f6] text-[#9ca3af] transition-all hover:bg-[#e5e7eb] hover:text-muted-foreground dark:bg-white/10 dark:hover:bg-white/20 dark:hover:text-gray-100\" aria-label=\"Send message\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                <path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick actions -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10\">Learn about Business</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10\">Start a chat</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10\">Research</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10\">API Platform</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#333333] underline-offset-4 transition-all hover:underline dark:text-muted-foreground\">More</a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Bento -->\n    <section class=\"mx-auto mt-14 max-w-7xl\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"group col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"relative aspect-[21/9] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567919914972-4281c4e0e7ae?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n              alt=\"Abstract dark technology visual\"\n              class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\"\n            />\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-gray-100\">\n              Frontier intelligence that scales with your ambition\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#666666] dark:text-muted-foreground\">Product <span class=\"mx-2\">•</span> 18 min read</p>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-1 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex flex-col gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526916027372-0c0852cef5d3?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n                alt=\"Wellness and calm lifestyle\"\n                class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 text-base font-semibold leading-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-gray-100\">\n                Launching Health in the assistant\n              </h4>\n              <p class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#666666] dark:text-muted-foreground\">Product <span class=\"mx-1\">•</span> Jul 23 <span class=\"mx-1\">•</span> 7 min</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex flex-col gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n                alt=\"Focused creative professional at work\"\n                class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 text-base font-semibold leading-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-gray-100\">\n                Take on your most ambitious work\n              </h4>\n              <p class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#666666] dark:text-muted-foreground\">5 min read</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Recent news -->\n    <section class=\"mx-auto mt-12 max-w-7xl\">\n      <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-baseline justify-between\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold dark:text-gray-100\">Recent news</h2>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium underline-offset-4 hover:underline dark:text-muted-foreground\">View more</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"relative h-24 w-24 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n              alt=\"Server hardware detail\"\n              class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"mb-1 text-base font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-gray-100\">\n              Advancing the price-performance frontier\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#666666] dark:text-muted-foreground\">Research <span class=\"mx-1\">•</span> Jun 12</p>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"relative h-24 w-24 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614064849377-2ec42b722a94?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n              alt=\"Abstract security lock visual\"\n              class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"mb-1 text-base font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-gray-100\">\n              A safety framework for long-running agents\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#666666] dark:text-muted-foreground\">Safety <span class=\"mx-1\">•</span> Jun 4</p>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n"
    }
  ]
